        if (!ATHAR_VAPID_PUBLIC_KEY) return '┘à┘ü╪¬╪º╪¡ ╪Ñ╪┤╪╣╪º╪▒╪º╪¬ Web Push ╪║┘è╪▒ ┘à╪╢╪¿┘ê╪╖.';
